---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms & Conditions | ManNeeds" description="Terms of Service for shopping on ManNeeds.">
  <section class="section policy-section">
    <div class="container policy-container">
      <span class="badge badge-green">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: November 2026 · <strong>ManNeeds</strong></p>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or placing an order on ManNeeds, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions and all applicable laws of India.</p>

        <h2>2. Products &amp; Pricing</h2>
        <p>All prices are listed in Indian Rupees (INR) and are inclusive of applicable taxes unless stated otherwise. Product weights (100g, 200g, 250g, 500g) and prices are displayed clearly before checkout.</p>

        <h2>3. Orders &amp; Payments</h2>
        <p>We accept Cash on Delivery (COD) as well as prepaid UPI, Debit Cards, and Credit Cards via Cashfree Payments. Orders are subject to stock availability and confirmation.</p>

        <h2>4. Food Safety &amp; Usage</h2>
        <p>Our products are 100% natural Indian kitchen essentials. Please check ingredient details and consult a healthcare professional before using herbal powders if you have specific allergies, are pregnant, or are on medication.</p>

        <h2>5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts in West Bengal, India.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .policy-section { padding: 3rem 0 4.5rem; background: var(--bg-base); }
  .policy-container { max-width: 820px; }
  .policy-updated { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .policy-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .policy-card h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .policy-card p { font-size: 0.94rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 639px) { .policy-card { padding: 1.35rem; } }
</style>
